From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: kierandrewett <kieran@drewett.dev>
Date: Sat, 26 Sep 2026 20:59:15 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] portal: preview wallpapers without GNOME Desktop libraries

---
